The minimum acceptable credit is reproduced in the NOTICE file. In source code
it belongs in a comment adjacent to the copied code; in a compiled application
it belongs in an about box, a credits screen, or an accompanying license file;
in written or recorded work it belongs in the body or the references.

Credit that is stripped, obscured, relocated to an unpublished file, or
replaced with your own authorship claim does not satisfy this section. You may
not represent the Software, or any part of it, as your own original work.


3. REDISTRIBUTION IS PROHIBITED

Except as expressly permitted by section 3.1, you may NOT distribute, publish,
