  d. Backups. You may keep private copies and backups for your own use.


4. ACCEPTABLE USE

Petri is a containment lab for BENIGN, simulated malware specimens that you
wrote yourself. As a condition of this license you may not:

  a. load, execute, analyze or store live malware, real malicious payloads, or
